        "product_summary": "Three colour-lining choices: Black Standard Lining, Black Plush Lining and Black White Standard Lining are separate order options.\nPanelled casual upper: Curved stitched side panels meet a pointed forefoot overlay, with gold-colour trim on all-black options and white trim on the white-sole option.\nLace-up details: Round black cords pass through plain eyestay openings, with a printed tongue tab and fabric pull loops.\nSole colour and tread: Black and white outsole options have sculpted sidewalls; source underside photos show triangular tread units.\nWholesale variant-size planning: Each of the three listed variants covers EU 39–46, with colour and lining identified in its SKU label.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
